{"articleNo":"1725","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1725&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"캠퍼스 방역소독 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.04.27","hit":"9337","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"left\"><font size=\"3\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 캠퍼스 방역소독 안내<br><br><br></strong><font size=\"2\">전염병의 발생과 유행을 방지하여 학내 구성원들의 보건을 향상시키고 쾌적한 면학분위기를 조성하고자 다음과 같이 방역소독을 실시하고자 합니다</font>.<br><br>\n</font></p><table style=\"WIDTH: 504px; HEIGHT: 197px\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" width=\"504\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n            <p align=\"center\"><font size=\"2\">건&nbsp; 물&nbsp; 별</font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n            <p align=\"center\"><font size=\"2\">일&nbsp; 정</font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n            <p align=\"center\"><font size=\"2\">비&nbsp; 고</font></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font size=\"2\">테크노관, 디지털관, 글로벌관</font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font size=\"2\">4월 28일(목)</font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font size=\"2\"></font></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font size=\"2\">도서관, 학생회관, 본관및강당, 이오스관</font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font size=\"2\">4월 29일(금)</font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font size=\"2\">본관 12:00~13:00</font></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <t